                                "sense_id": "f6f60ecd-8d98-30ac-b1b5-a2b826df8e37",
                                "text": "In 1981, their twin daughters, Barbara and Jenna (named after their grandmothers) were born. In 1994, George W. Bush was elected governor of Texas."
